WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Sit tall and bring the soles of the feet together, knees falling open.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Hold the feet or ankles and lengthen the spine.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
To deepen, hinge forward from the hips with a long spine.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Relax the inner thighs and breathe.
